    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Through Quiet Skies</strong> is a short atmospheric exploration game where you walk the remnants of a world long gone with a unique and breath taking art style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No dialogue. No combat. Just you, the wind, and traces of something\u2026 or someone\u2026 or, everyone... left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient ruins, overgrown paths, and cryptic messages carved into stone \u2014 fragments of a forgotten poem scattered across the land. Piece them together, and maybe you'll understand what happened\u2026 and why you were meant to see it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calm, emotional experience about memory, endings, and the quiet beauty in what's left behind.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Through Quiet Skies</strong> is a short atmospheric exploration game where you walk the remnants of a world long gone with a unique and breath taking art style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No dialogue. No combat. Just you, the wind, and traces of something\u2026 or someone\u2026 or, everyone... left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient ruins, overgrown paths, and cryptic messages carved into stone \u2014 fragments of a forgotten poem scattered across the land. Piece them together, and maybe you'll understand what happened\u2026 and why you were meant to see it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calm, emotional experience about memory, endings, and the quiet beauty in what's left behind.</p>",
    "short_description": "Walk alone through a stunning forgotten world where nothing speaks \u2014 except the stones. A quiet, story-driven journey through memory, mystery, and the fading light.",
